; A contract position past Decimal's range: booking rejects the inventory
; before check_option_expiry runs, so the plugin's overflow skip is never
; what decides the result (#2661 review).
plugin "beancount_options.check_option_expiry"
2026-01-01 open Assets:Opt
2026-01-01 open Assets:Opt2
2026-09-03 * "a"
  Assets:Opt  50000000000000000000000000000 AAPL261016P00100000
  Assets:Opt2  -50000000000000000000000000000 AAPL261016P00100000
2026-09-04 * "b"
  Assets:Opt  50000000000000000000000000000 AAPL261016P00100000
  Assets:Opt2  -50000000000000000000000000000 AAPL261016P00100000
2026-11-01 note Assets:Opt "x"
